        <mxCell id="hypothesis" value="&lt;b&gt;Research Hypothesis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;A spectral-side QNN acts as decision-boundary regularization in low-shot HSI classification.&lt;br&gt;The effect should be reported as dataset- and shot-dependent, not as universal QNN superiority.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d7dee7;shadow=1;fontSize=17;fontColor=#1e2d3a;align=left;spacingLeft=22;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
